# Best Practices

### Use Drill-Through

Drill-through preserves context and provides more focused analysis.

---

### Monitor Completion Percentage

Completion Percentage is the primary performance indicator throughout the dashboard.

---

### Investigate Pending Projects

Pending projects should be reviewed regularly to maintain confirmation targets.

